-06T18:33:34-07:00","id":1125755,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1125260-sequel-or-20-for-sorcerer-v2?p=1125650#post1125650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I doubt that OPP will get a chance since nWW is taking over things. I doubt that nWW will care about Sorcerers because their magical system is not flashy enough for a video game (nWW just seems to be preparing fans for the video games, TV shows, and movies that will be derived from the IP).</div> </div> </div> </div>It would probably be a lot easier to translate into a video game than Mage, mechanics wise. (Mass Effect series biotics for psychics for a recent one.)<br /> <br /> Personally, I would love to see it, and we had a nice thread about it started, but it's mostly just some ideas thrown at the wall. ( <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/559836-updating-and-expanding-sorcerer?_=1441244964891\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1441244964891</a> ).<br /> <br /> I've been tempted to do a 'faction' writeup for some of the groups that already might tie over from other game lines (Tremere, Settites, Uktena Kin, 8th Sun, etc) but... I'm too lazy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","valu